  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">B&#xf6;nder och EU</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-info to farmers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Litauen ska inleda f&#xf6;rhandlingar ang&#xe5;ende medlemskap i EU. Syftet med denna insats &#xe4;r att informera lantbrukare om EU f&#xf6;r att p&#xe5; s&#xe5; vis f&#xf6;rbereda inf&#xf6;r EU-intr&#xe4;det. Denna information kommer att &#xf6;verf&#xf6;ras genom seminarieverksamhet och produktion av informationsmaterial. Svensk samarbetspart &#xe4;r LRF genom dotterbolaget SwedeAgri AB.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lithuania is in the process of starting negotiations with EU about membership. The purpose of this project is to inform the Lituanian farmers about EU and to prepare for a future membership. This will be carried out through seminars and production of information materials. Swedish counterpart is the National Farmers Association (LRF).</narrative>
  </description>
